{
  "name": "ICM | Update Position",
  "environment": "tool",
  "note": "WRITES on tool, to fixtures it creates and deletes itself. Every row is named KITTEST-UPDPOS-* and dated 2030 or later, so no real seat, period or payout is touched. The position is created through ICM | Create Position, and every dated change is re-read through ICM | List Positions on BOTH sides of its date: the store is the evidence, not the automation's own status. Cases run in order and depend on each other.",
